{%- when 'emerald' -%}
  <div class="gem-tab gem-tab--emerald">
    <h2>Who should wear</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Students and lifelong learners</li>
      <li>Writers, speakers, and content creators</li>
      <li>Analysts, consultants, and advisors</li>
      <li>Traders, business professionals, and strategists</li>
      <li>Anyone experiencing mental restlessness, communication blocks, or lack of clarity</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Commonly Considered During</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Budh Mahadasha or Antardasha</li>
      <li>When Mercury is weak, afflicted, or underperforming in the natal chart</li>
      <li>Phases of study, exams, interviews, or skill-building</li>
      <li>Periods requiring better communication, memory, or mental steadiness</li>
      <li>When clarity in business, negotiation, or learning becomes especially important</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Important</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>⚠️ Wear only after proper astrological consultation and suitability testing.</li>
      <li>Emerald is a powerful Mercury gemstone, and as per Vedic Jyotish, it should be worn only when it is genuinely supportive in the chart.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
