{%- when 'tourmaline' -%}
  <div class="gem-tab gem-tab--tourmaline">
    <h2>Who Should Wear Tourmaline</h2>
    <p>Tourmaline is a gemstone of balance, grounding, and emotional alignment — suited to those who seek calm clarity without intensity, and inner steadiness without the weight of a primary planetary stone.</p>
    <p>It may be considered when emotional sensitivity or overstimulation has become persistent, when you are moving through a period of change or transition and need grounding rather than amplification, when you seek the calm focus that comes from feeling centred rather than driven, or when meditation, healing work, or inner practice is a meaningful part of daily life. It is a considered choice for those who need the qualities of a stronger Venus or Jupiter stone — grace, wisdom, emotional balance — in a form that does not overwhelm.</p>
  </div>
{%- when 'aquamarine' -%}
  <div class="gem-tab gem-tab--aquamarine">
    <h2>Who Should Wear Aquamarine</h2>
    <p>Aquamarine is often chosen by those seeking calm, clarity, and emotional steadiness rather than intensity or pressure. It is especially suited to people whose lives or work depend on thoughtful communication and balanced decision-making.</p>
    <h4>Often Suited For</h4>
    <ul>
    <li>Writers, speakers, teachers, and counsellors</li>
    <li>Those navigating stress, overthinking, or emotional overwhelm</li>
    <li>People seeking calmer communication and clearer expression</li>
    <li>Individuals who prefer gentle emotional balance over forceful energy</li>
    <li>Anyone moving through demanding phases that require composure and mental clarity</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Aquamarine does not force clarity.</p>
    <p>It creates the space where clarity naturally arrives.</p>
    <p>जो रत्न दबाव नहीं बनाता,</p>
    <p>वही सबसे सहज साथ देता है।</p>
    <h4>What Makes Aquamarine Special</h4>
    <p>Aquamarine is not prized for darkness or intensity. Its beauty — and its value — lies in the opposite: light, openness, and composure. A fine Aquamarine is valued for the cleanness of its blue, the depth of its transparency, and the way it seems to hold calm within itself rather than reflecting it from the surface.</p>
    <p>It is a stone of grace over intensity, clarity over drama, and presence that does not need to announce itself. These are precisely the qualities it is worn to cultivate.</p>
  </div>
